  message: "Closed by PR (commit f9bcc5f84). ADR-0028 (Draft) lands the four-part ADR-0024 axis-declaration template instantiation for Edge.evidence_type: §1 Context (210-value cluster taxonomy from WI-turin-pajuk; confirms ADR-0023 Open Question #2's prediction), §2 Decision (evidence_type names inference pathway only; Cluster B resolution status promotes to new sibling Edge.is_resolved: bool = True per ADR-0024 §Fold-residue discipline rule 3 — recurrence threshold met; Cluster C framework conventions fold to canonical + meta['framework_dispatch']/meta['detection_pattern']; Cluster D apex/peer call variants collapse to canonical apex + meta['call_construct']), §3 Detailed analysis (per-cluster fold targets — high-level only; per-value verdicts file as audit-findings docs), §4 Consumer pattern ((evidence_type, is_resolved, meta)), §5 Enforcement (axis_drift.find_drift with name_filter='EVIDENCE_TYPE', scripts/check-evidence-type-drift), §6 Migration plan (four phases mirroring ADR-0023; Phase 1 also lands the new sibling field; Phase 4 ships piecewise across 5–7 sub-ships gated on bakeoff validation). Largest concept-axis migration on the roadmap (~140 production files; 7–12 days Phase 3 + multi-week Phase 4). Sibling axis to ADR-0027; both ADRs ship in parallel with no Phase 1 implementation overlap. Pure documentation: 4 files / 335 insertions / no code or tests. Subsequent phase tracker items file once Phase 1 lands."  # 53b4
